From e138f7482fd33b3591fbe76949441dd6aee88f28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frontend Improvements <assistant@memo.local>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 08:54:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Frontend polish: fix missing animations, replace native
 alert/confirm, add live similarity detection in Add Mistake, stronger sidebar
 active state

- Add missing fadeIn/scaleIn/slideUp keyframes to tailwind.config.js (were used across every component but never defined, so transitions were silently no-ops)
- New ConfirmDialog component replaces window.confirm() in MyMemories delete flow
- New Toast/ToastContainer replaces window.alert() for form validation and delete/status feedback, wired through App.tsx
- AddMistake now runs a live local similarity check (reusing matchSimilarityLocally) as the user types title/description, surfacing a dismissible 'this looks familiar' panel with match %, mirroring the Ask Memory experience
- AddMistake validation now shows an inline error banner + toast listing exactly which required fields are missing, instead of a generic browser alert
- Sidebar active tab now has a left accent bar + pulsing dot for a clearer active state
---
